---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import MobileMenu from '../components/MobileMenu.astro';
import ContactCta from '../components/ContactCta.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const path = Astro.url.pathname;
---
<Layout
  title="San Cristóbal de las Casas · Lara San Cristóbal"
  description="Your guide to San Cristóbal de las Casas — a thriving highland city in Chiapas, Mexico, with a rising property market, strong rental demand and a remarkable quality of life."
  esHref="/san-cristobal-es"
>
  <Header esHref="/san-cristobal-es" />
  <MobileMenu currentPath={path} />

  <section id="top" style="position: relative; min-height: 78vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; overflow: hidden; padding: clamp(110px, 16vh, 180px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px) clamp(40px, 6vh, 72px);">
    <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden;">
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/c_fill,ar_16:9,g_auto,w_2000/f_auto,q_auto/v1788342266/AdobeStock_1511049624_Preview_crvdof.jpg" alt="San Cristóbal de las Casas" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
      <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(34, 31, 28, 0.34) 0%, rgba(34, 31, 28, 0.3) 40%, rgba(34, 31, 28, 0.66) 100%);"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="position: relative; max-width: 1400px; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 36px;">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px;">
        <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(251, 248, 243, 0.72);">The town</span>
        <h1 style="margin: 0; max-width: 18ch; font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 200; font-size: clamp(35px, 5.10vw, 84px); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: 0.005em; color: #FBF8F3; text-wrap: pretty;">A city that is thriving</h1>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.7vw, 25px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.45; letter-spacing: 0.005em; color: rgba(251, 248, 243, 0.9);">Rich culture and a rising market…</p>
      </div>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; max-width: 36ch; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(251, 248, 243, 0.86);">San Cristóbal has such a lot to offer from a lifestyle perspective, but also as a destination for investment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal="1" style="padding: clamp(70px, 12vh, 150px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px) clamp(30px, 5vh, 60px);">
    <div style="max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 86px); align-items: start;">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 200; font-size: clamp(23px, 2.46vw, 35px); line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.01em; text-wrap: pretty;">As more and more people are seeking alternative lifestyles, from overseas as well as from Mexico's highly populated cities, the property market here is very vibrant.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; padding-top: 8px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.9; color: #6E655C;">Well priced, well presented properties tend to sell highly efficiently and rent easily, and whilst land prices are steadily rising, there are still some exceptional opportunities to purchase plots and larger tracts of land for seriously competitive prices, making the more tried and tested investment destinations such as Tulum and Playa look very expensive indeed.</p>
        <a href="/property-for-sale" style="align-self: flex-start; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(43, 38, 34, 0.28); padding-bottom: 5px;">See property for sale</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal="1" style="padding: clamp(40px, 7vh, 90px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px);">
    <div style="max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 80px); align-items: center;">
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/c_fill,g_auto,w_1200/f_auto,q_auto/v1788461271/LSC_29_nun3w8.jpg" alt="Street life in San Cristóbal de las Casas" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; background: #E4D8C8;" />
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px;">
        <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6E655C;">Life in the city</span>
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 200; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.52vw, 55px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em; text-wrap: pretty;">Luxurious hotels, sophisticated cafés, and traditions firmly intact</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr)); gap: 22px 34px;">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.9; color: #6E655C;">The city itself is thriving, and is home to a wide range of luxurious hotels, sophisticated cafés, stylish restaurants, natural stores and fashion boutiques.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.9; color: #6E655C;">There is a growing middle class here, beautifully balanced by the indigenous communities that surround the town, offering a unique splash of culture and colour for all who live here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal="1" style="margin-top: clamp(40px, 7vh, 90px); background: #221F1C; color: #F2EDE6; padding: clamp(60px, 10vh, 120px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px);">
    <div style="max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px);">
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(26px, 5vw, 80px); align-items: end;">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.55);">The case for investment</span>
          <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 200; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.34vw, 51px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em; text-wrap: pretty;">Four reasons people are buying here now</h2>
        </div>
        <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 40ch; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.85; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.72);">Whether you are a buy-to-let investor looking for fantastic value, a stable market and reliable returns, or looking to relocate, San Cristóbal presents a compelling case.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 1px; background: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.14);">
        <div style="background: #221F1C; padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 38px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-height: 190px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25;">Older, characterful houses</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.7);">Truly excellent opportunities to buy and improve in the historic centre and beyond.</span>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #221F1C; padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 38px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-height: 190px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25;">A lucrative Airbnb market</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.7);">Highly active for tourism and for short and medium term stays.</span>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #221F1C; padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 38px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-height: 190px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25;">Growing expat arrivals</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.7);">Typically looking for good quality rentals initially, and later purchasing.</span>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #221F1C; padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 38px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-height: 190px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25;">Land still priced kindly</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.7);">Plots and larger tracts at prices that make Tulum and Playa look expensive.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal="1" style="padding: clamp(60px, 10vh, 130px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px) clamp(20px, 4vh, 40px);">
    <div class="img-row" style="max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; gap: 12px; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none;">
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/c_fill,ar_3:4,g_auto,w_900/f_auto,q_auto/v1788342261/AdobeStock_1511049897_Preview_u3ydl9.jpg" alt="San Cristóbal de las Casas" style="width: clamp(200px, 24vw, 340px); aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; object-fit: cover; background: #E4D8C8;" />
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/c_fill,ar_3:4,g_auto,w_900/f_auto,q_auto/v1788342263/AdobeStock_104631534_Preview_fpxeue.jpg" alt="San Cristóbal de las Casas" style="width: clamp(200px, 24vw, 340px); aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; object-fit: cover; background: #E4D8C8;" />
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/c_fill,ar_3:4,g_auto,w_900/f_auto,q_auto/v1788342260/AdobeStock_408245433_Preview_suwz4t.jpg" alt="San Cristóbal de las Casas" style="width: clamp(200px, 24vw, 340px); aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; object-fit: cover; background: #E4D8C8;" />
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/c_fill,ar_3:4,g_auto,w_900/f_auto,q_auto/v1788342259/AdobeStock_170541043_Preview_jmenhi.jpg" alt="San Cristóbal de las Casas" style="width: clamp(200px, 24vw, 340px); aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; object-fit: cover; background: #E4D8C8;" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <ContactCta heading="Considering the highlands of Chiapas? Let's talk." />
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .img-row {
      display: grid !important;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important;
      overflow-x: visible !important;
      gap: 6px !important;
    }
    .img-row img {
      width: 100% !important;
    }
  }
</style>
